 "warnings": [
  "PNG contains TWO portrait BOQ sheets laid out side by side in one landscape scan, per spec §11. Rotate the PNG 90 degrees counter-clockwise to read. The physical RIGHT half is the LOWER-numbered sheet and is written to _1.json; the physical LEFT half is _2.json.",
  "EVERY PRICE COLUMN IS BLANK ON EVERY ROW OF THE WHOLE BOQ -- ราคาหน่วยละ, จำนวนเงิน (material and labour), and รวมค่าวัสดุและค่าแรงงาน. This is a แบบ ปร.4 QUANTITY schedule issued unpriced by กองมาตรฐานราคากลาง for the estimator to fill in. Nulls are transcribed, never invented.",
  "The title block is identical on every sheet of the set: form แบบ ปร.4, drawing numbers S-62047 / AR-61142 / SN-62034 / EE-62062 / M-62028, สถานที่ก่อสร้าง ทั่วไป, unit บาท, with ประมาณการโดย and ประมาณราคาเมื่อวันที่ left blank.",
  "*** THE SEVEN EXHAUST FANS RECONCILE EXACTLY WITH M-01's SCHEDULE AND WITH THE M-02/M-03 PLAN COUNTS: EF-1 x1 (520 CFM), CEF-1 x3 (50 CFM), CEF-2 x1 (80 CFM), CEF-3 x2 (230 CFM). *** Capacities and static pressures are identical to M-01, and the plan positions on M-02 and M-03 add up to the same numbers -- a three-way agreement.",
  "*** THE GRILLE COUNTS ALSO MATCH THE CEILING FANS ONE-FOR-ONE: 3 x 6\"x4\", 1 x 6\"x6\", 2 x 10\"x8\" -- exactly the sizes tagged beside CEF-1, CEF-2 and CEF-3 on the M-02/M-03 plans. *** The wall-mounted EF-1 gets no grille, correctly.",
  "'W/ins.' on the grille line means WITH INSULATION -- matching the plans' 'EAG ... w/ins FLEX-ø' tags.",
  "FLEXIBLE DUCT IS ONLY 9 M IN TOTAL (4 m of ø6\" and 5 m of ø10\"), so each ceiling fan has roughly 1-2 m of flex to its grille. The ø6\" serves CEF-1 and CEF-2, the ø10\" serves the two CEF-3s.",
  "The fan capacities are given with their external static pressure (@0.05 in.wg.) for the ceiling units, exactly as M-01 tabulates. EF-1 has no static pressure, being a direct wall propeller."
 ]
